  unitName: Turbo Euryalis
  unitId: 830125
  unitNumber: 8058
  description: Euryalis is a codename given to these augmented machines when they
    were created by Gazia, a demi-god fallen into his abyss of power and stature
    during the days of the augmentation wars in Athenshpere. The Euryalis were built
    to mimic the cunning of mystical gorgons. They slither through the forested lands
    swiftly while receptor weapons on their heads track and hunt for enemies. It
    was rumored that Gazia infused the soul of Zahhaks into each Euryalis he created
    which makes them even more deadly and intelligent.
  summonDesc: "DESTROY\u2026"
  fusionDesc: "Hisssss\u2026 [Beep.. Beep..]"
